#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:38
msgid "👋General information"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:39
msgid ""
"Collabora Office spreadsheet can be used to calculate, analyze, and manage "
"your data. This introduction template will help you get started and explore "
"some of the main features of the product."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:40
msgid "Calc features – key features you can explore"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:41
msgid "Calculations (Formulas & Functions)"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:42
msgid ""
"Use built-in functions to perform calculations on your data. Create formulas"
" easily and get help with the Function Wizard."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:43
msgid "Tables"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:44
msgid ""
"Organize your data into structured tables. Quickly edit, sort, and filter "
"information to keep everything clear and easy to manage."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:45
msgid "Charts"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:46
msgid ""
"Visualize your data with different chart types. Quickly create and customize"
" charts to better understand trends and comparisons."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:47
msgid "Sorting & filtering"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:48
msgid ""
"Find what matters faster by sorting and filtering your data. Focus only on "
"the information you need."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:49
msgid "Data formatting"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:50
msgid ""
"Format your data to improve clarity and readability. Use colors, styles, and"
" number formats to highlight key information."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:51
msgid "Collaboration tools "
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:52
msgid ""
"Work together in real time. Share, comment, and track changes directly in "
"the document."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:53
