msgid "Editing tables"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:97
msgid ""
"When a table is created, additional tools become available in the toolbar. "
"These tools allow you to customize and manage your table more easily. You "
"can apply different table styles to improve the visual appearance of your "
"data. You can also enable or disable options such as header rows, banded "
"rows, and filter buttons, depending on how you want to display and work with"
" your data."
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:98
msgid "Pivot table"
msgstr ""

#: Calc-Intro-Template.ods:99
msgid ""
"The pivot table (formerly known as DataPilot) allows you to combine, "
"compare, and analyze large amounts of data. You can view different summaries"
" of the source data, you can display the details of areas of interest, and "
"you can create reports. "
msgstr ""

